SUMMARY:Gentle Yoga: Spring into Joy!
DESCRIPTION:Come enjoy gentle Yoga in the Fireside Room. This 6-week offering focuses on springtime joy with gentle yoga that includes breathwork\, gentle stretching and balance. Your body\, mind and heart will thank you for giving yourself this gift! \nOffered by teachers Jennifer Hogan and Diane Parro \n6 Tuesdays\nApril 7 – May 12\n10:15 – 11:15 a.m.\nFireside Room\, 412 C Street\n$90/series or $20 drop in\nSliding scale available!
